  displayName: Marshal Command Tank
  role: 1
  description: 'A Sagittarius main battle tank refitted as a mobile headquarters,
    its turret bristling with antennae and a satellite uplink. It fights like any
    Sagittarius: 20 health and Armor Level 4, a 100mm Cannon (10 damage, penetration
    4, 50 m, once a turn) and a Frag Grenade every turn. It moves 30 m but, being
    Mechanical, can''t sprint, and when destroyed it has a 10% chance to explode
    (Unstable). A Commander: every army needs exactly one.'
